  "description": "Sweet, adorable Narae. The girl next door that everyone loves! Except, she has just one little secret- she fantasizes about having sex with anyone and everyone! Men, women, BDSM, toys, you name it, it’s in there. Nothing is off limits for Narae. Now these fantasies are starting to get out of control and affect her dating (and social) life. With help from the mysterious shamaness Nokjoo and the influential Miss Miso, Narae will find a way to make these fantasies a reality and finally get herself a boyfriend.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
